# =============================================================================
# HARD DATA / RESULTS GUARD
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is CODE / METHOD ONLY. The underlying study is under journal
# peer review, so NO measured data and NO results may be committed. The patterns
# below are a safety net: keep them, and never force-add anything they match.
# =============================================================================

